        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Ebert, Avicii\n- Bands: Ima Robot, of Montreal, Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeros\n- Places: Los Angeles, California, Athens, Georgia\n- Songs: “For a Better Day”\n- Companies: Universal Music\n\nFacts:\n- Ima Robot formed in the late 1990s and is based in Los Angeles, California.\n- of Montreal is an American experimental pop band from Athens, Georgia.\n- Alex Ebert is best known as the lead singer and songwriter for Ima Robot and Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeros.\n- “For a Better Day” is a 2015 single by Swedish EDM producer Avicii featuring uncredited vocals by American singer Alex Ebert.\n- Universal Music released “For a Better Day.”",
